(1189, 'shopee-erp-api', 'Shopee ERP开放平台API', NULL, NULL, 'product', '商品', 'v2_product_init_tier_variation', '初始化多级规格', 'This API allows you to update the tier structure of a product. Defining only color creates one tier, while color + size creates two tiers (maximum supported). Supported changes include: no tier ↔ one/two tiers, one tier ↔ two/no tier, and two tiers ↔ one/no tier. For details, see Developer Guide. Please wait at least 5 seconds after creating an item before creating variants, as processing may be delayed.', '初始化多级规格。', 'POST', '/api/v2/product/init_tier_variation', 1, 0),
